# Project: Anomaly Detection LLM Study

**What:** Replication + extension of AnoLLM (ICLR 2025). We replicate SmolLM-360M likelihood scoring on 30 ODDS datasets, then extend with Qwen2.5-3B, prompted suspiciousness scoring (Mode B), and security-domain datasets (credit card fraud, UNSW-NB15).

**Package:** `anodet/` — Python 3.10, `uv` only (no pip/conda). Run via `uv run`.

**Repo:** `github.com/soumitra9/anomaly-llm-study` (public), branch `main`.

