## Key science facts
- AnoLLM uses **SmolLM-360M** (not Llama/Mistral). Bigger models are NOT better (135M=0.884, 360M=0.865, 1.7B=0.861 AUROC).
- AnoLLM did NOT "lose" to classical detectors — it is competitive/tied on numerical ODDS and wins on mixed-type data. See `docs/claude/memory/project-premise-correction.md`.
